The requirements in this chapter apply to a CRR firm with respect to the carrying on of the following activities from an establishment in the UK:
*   regulated activities;
*   activities that constitute dealing in investments as principal, disregarding the exclusion in article 15 of the Regulated Activities Order;
*   ancillary activities;
*   in relation to MiFID business, ancillary services; and
*   unregulated activities in a prudential context [7][8].

Additionally, the requirements apply in a prudential context with respect to activities wherever they are carried on, and taking into account any activity of other members of a group of which the firm is a member [7][8].
